text CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_PhotoOfBlaineAndFuji {
    "It's a photo of Blaine and\n"
    "Mr. Fuji.\p"
    "They're standing shoulder to\n"
    "shoulder with big grins.$"
}

text CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Entrance_Text_StudyMonsExtensively {
    "We study Pokémon extensively\n"
    "every day.\p"
    "People often bring us rare Pokémon\n"
    "for examination.$"
}

text CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Entrance_Text_PhotoOfLabFounderDrFuji {
    "A photo of the Lab's founder…\n"
    "Dr. Fuji?!$"
}

